kernel,', '  remain limits of the retained de Bruijn backends after phase 8; none\\\\n  is a limit of the carrier or of the canonical semantic-register kernel,')\nedit('| exclusive/holder is phase 7 |', '| exclusive/holder is phase 7; superseded by §10.8 P1. **Amended after 7 (2026-10-14)** — Reason: 7a implements the by-kind custody slot |')\nedit(\\\"editing their offset tables for a phase-8 deletion was not worth a slice |\\\", \\\"editing both kernels' offset tables is outside the retained backend fragment (§4.6); **Amended after 7 (2026-10-14)** — Reason: the owner retains both backends |\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md'); s=p.read_text()\nedit('The driver\\\\'s exit persists recovery and body, journals the fence, attempts\\\\nthe stable successor offer, reports that exact successor/body, carries', \\\"**Amended after 7 (2026-10-14)** — Reason: the row driver persists a recovery object and a pack.\\\\nThe driver's exit persists the recovery object and the pack, journals the\\\\nfence, attempts the stable successor offer, reports that exact\\\\nsuccessor/pack, carries\\\")\nedit('before the body is attempted; a retry re-brackets from the recovery', 'before the pack is attempted; a retry re-brackets from the recovery')\nedit('   version or a float \"'`3.0`, or corrupt a child task'\"\\\\'s profile. Carrier\\\\n   gate/structure validation refuses before attach, proposals or restore;', '   version or a float \"'`3.0`.'\"\\\\n   **Amended after 7 (2026-10-14)** — Reason: the inspector fixtures do not include a corrupt child profile.\\\\n   Carrier gate/structure validation refuses before attach, proposals or restore;')\nedit('   (including current lease, epoch or holder), or non-origin keys on\\\\n   a halted root. Every child custody slot must be nil.', '   (e.g. current lease or epoch), or non-origin keys on a halted root.\\\\n   **Amended after 7 (2026-10-14)** — Reason: lease and epoch fixtures exist; a holder-key fixture is absent.\\\\n   Every child custody slot must be nil.')\nedit('    using packs. Recovery format 2 is stored before the whole pack, both\\\\n    fenced before publication. Pack addresses name offers, checkpoints', '    using packs.\\\\n    **Amended after 7 (2026-10-14)** — Reason: the fence is journaled after both durable stores.\\\\n    Recovery format 2 is stored before the whole pack; both are stored durably before the fence is journaled and before any offer.\\\\n    Pack addresses name offers, checkpoints')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\n git diff --check\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
